### Grasshopper / Rhino / WASPer_3DP plugin ignore rules ###

# OS / file-manager clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Grasshopper user objects, autosave junk
*.ghx-autosave
*.ghautosave
*.ghbackup

# WASPer generated simulation/cache outputs
*.mb05cache
**/WASPer_Mb05_Cache/
*.cache
**/graphs_temp/

# Compiled Grasshopper assemblies
*.gha
*.ghlib

# Avoid committing Yak build output
# Versioned Yak package folders (treat as build artefacts)
v1.*/
*.yak
yak_dist/

# Avoid committing local release folders
00_Backup/
food_for_rhino/
package_manager/

# Local Grasshopper definition backups (if large)
WASPer_3DP_WIP*.gh
~*.gh
~*.ghuser

# VS - Bin and Obj are already ignored above, but add explicitly:
bin/
obj/
.vs/
**/.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser

# Rhino temp
*.3dm.autosave
*.rui_bak
*.rhp
*.rhl
*.rws

# Mac Rhino temp (safe to include)
*.MacOS

# Logs / local test output
*.log
TestResults/
*.trx

# Python cache if you use GHPython in-source
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.venvs/
**/.venv/
**/.venvs/

# Don't commit local build resources, source archives, or viewer output
**/*Archive*/
*.Backup.tmp
05_VVVV/**/build/
05_VVVV/**/.wasper-viewer/
05_VVVV/WASPerProcessViewer/config/current-job.txt

# Most local XR / VVVV experiments are not part of the public WASPer_3DP source release.
# The Phase 1 build dependencies are explicitly unignored below; unrelated viewers,
# experiments, and third-party samples remain private.
# Keep experimental XR workspaces private, but publish the three projects required
# to build the Phase 1 plugin and its bundled browser viewer from a clean clone.
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/*
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/*
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/WASPer.LiveLink.Protocol/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/WASPer.LiveLink.Protocol/**
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/WASPer.LiveLink.Protocol/bin/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/01_LiveLink/WASPer.LiveLink.Protocol/obj/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/*
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/WASPer.XR.Core/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/WASPer.XR.Core/**
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/WASPer.XR.Core/bin/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/05_Core/WASPer.XR.Core/obj/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/*
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPER_PROCESS_VIEWER_GUIDE.md
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/scripts/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/scripts/**
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/**
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/bin/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/obj/
04_WASPer_3DP.XR_Structure.txt
05_VVVV/
**/*.vl.bak*
**/*.vl.overwritten_by_vvvv_*
**/*.psmdcp

# Local temporary investigations and copied package contents
tmp/
**/VL.Rhino.EDU.*/
**/VL.Rhino.3dm.*/

# Local plans, trials, backups, and conversion snapshots
00_Plans/
00_Trials/
Trials/
00_WASPer_ChangeLog.txt
00_Backups*/
01_WASPer_3DP/00_Backups/
**/_cp1252_to_utf8_backup_*/
**/_mojibake_backup_*/

# Generated XR packages and study payloads can be very large and are not source.
*.wasperxr
*.wasperxr.json
*.3dmbak
*.3dm
*.vsidx

# Phase 1 WebViewer ships one source-controlled sample job; all other generated
# WASPer XR payloads remain ignored.
!04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/SampleData/wasper-xr-sample.wasperxr.json
04_WASPer_3DP.XR/07_WebViewer/WASPer.XR.WebViewer/wwwroot/_extracted.js

# Phase 1 public-source boundary. The private Performance project (categories 8-9.3:
# morphology, boundary conditions, heat transfer, moisture buffering, structural) lives
# here and stays outside the public repository until Phase 2.
05_WASPer_3DP.Performance/
01_WASPer_3DP/WASPer_3DP.Private.sln

# Defensive: keep these ignored even if a maintainer ever restores Performance-only
# files next to the public source at their old (pre-split) locations.
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/8_Morphology/
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/9.0_BCs/
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/9.1_Heat Transfer/
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/9.2_Moisture_Buffering/
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/9.3_Structural/
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/Shared/Performance/WASPer_BoundaryTypes.cs
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/Shared/Performance/WASPer_MoistureDiffusionSolver.cs
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/Shared/Performance/WASPer_NstSimParams.cs
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/Shared/Performance/WASPer_GridSparseSolver.cs
01_WASPer_3DP/Components/Shared/Performance/WASPer_ThermalCommon.cs
# Maintained Phase 1 reference example. It remains public even though the full
# Performance component source is withheld until Phase 2.
!01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Examples/HeatTransferNew_260622.gh
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/16_heat_trasnfer.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/17_surface_area.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/18_Tortuosity.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/wsp_BC*.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/wsp_Ch*.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/wsp_Ht*.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/wsp_Mb*.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Resources/Icons/wsp_St*.png
01_WASPer_3DP/Tools/TensorMesh/
# The exact Rhino/Grasshopper 8.17 reference assemblies below are intentional
# public build dependencies. Keep every other future ThirdParty payload ignored.
01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/*
!01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/GH817/
01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/GH817/*
!01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/GH817/GH_IO.dll
!01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/GH817/Grasshopper.dll
!01_WASPer_3DP/ThirdParty/GH817/RhinoCommon.dll
